    "code": "VISA-A",
    "title": "Victorian Institute of Sport Assessment - Achilles (VISA-A)",
    "category": "outcome_measures",
    "content": "<h3>VISA-A (Achilles Tendinopathy Clinical Assessment)</h3>\n<div class=\"excel-table-wrap\">\n  <table class=\"excel-table\" data-calc-group=\"visa-a\">\n    <thead>\n      <tr>\n        <th style=\"width: 42%;\">Section / Item Description<div class=\"col-resizer\"></div></th>\n        <th style=\"width: 28%;\">Response Scale / Range<div class=\"col-resizer\"></div></th>\n        <th style=\"width: 14%;\" class=\"text-center\">Patient Score<div class=\"col-resizer\"></div></th>\n        <th style=\"width: 16%;\">Notes / Cutoff<div class=\"col-resizer\"></div></th>\n      </tr>\n    </thead>\n    <tbody>\n      <tr><td>1. Morning stiffness in tendon (0 = &gt;2 hrs to 10 = none)</td><td class=\"text-slate-500\">0 to 10 points</td><td><input type=\"number\" class=\"excel-input\" data-group=\"visa-a\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" value=\"10\" /></td><td><span class=\"risk-pill risk-neutral\">Stiffness</span></td></tr>\n      <tr><td>2. Pain on stretching / touching tendon</td><td class=\"text-slate-500\">0: Severe to 10: None</td><td><input type=\"number\" class=\"excel-input\" data-group=\"visa-a\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" value=\"10\" /></td><td><span class=\"risk-pill risk-neutral\">Palpation</span></td></tr>\n      <tr><td>3. Pain after walking flat for 2 hours</td><td class=\"text-slate-500\">0: Severe to 10: None</td><td><input type=\"number\" class=\"excel-input\" data-group=\"visa-a\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" value=\"10\" /></td><td><span class=\"risk-pill risk-neutral\">Walking</span></td></tr>\n      <tr><td>4. Pain on first 20-30 steps in the morning</td><td class=\"text-slate-500\">0: Severe to 10: None</td><td><input type=\"number\" class=\"excel-input\" data-group=\"visa-a\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" value=\"10\" /></td><td><span class=\"risk-pill risk-neutral\">Morning Steps</span></td></tr>\n      <tr><td>5. Single-leg heel raise on flat</td><td class=\"text-slate-500\">0: Unable to 10: Pain-free</td><td><input type=\"number\" class=\"excel-input\" data-group=\"visa-a\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" value=\"10\" /></td><td><span class=\"risk-pill risk-neutral\">Calf Raise</span></td></tr>\n      <tr><td>6. Single-leg hops on flat ground (&ge;10 hops)</td><td class=\"text-slate-500\">0: Unable to 10: Pain-free</td><td><input type=\"number\" class=\"excel-input\" data-group=\"visa-a\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" value=\"10\" /></td><td><span class=\"risk-pill risk-neutral\">Hopping</span></td></tr>\n      <tr><td>7. Current sports / physical activity participation</td><td class=\"text-slate-500\">0: Nil to 10: Full unmodified</td><td><input type=\"number\" class=\"excel-input\" data-group=\"visa-a\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" value=\"10\" /></td><td><span class=\"risk-pill risk-neutral\">Sport</span></td></tr>\n      <tr><td>8. Sport duration &amp; tendon load tolerance</td><td class=\"text-slate-500\">0: None to 30: Full training</td><td><input type=\"number\" class=\"excel-input\" data-group=\"visa-a\" min=\"0\" max=\"30\" value=\"30\" /></td><td><span class=\"risk-pill risk-neutral\">Load Max 30</span></td></tr>\n      <tr class=\"excel-total-row\">\n        <td colspan=\"2\" class=\"font-bold\">\n          Total Score: <span class=\"excel-sum font-mono\" data-sum-target=\"visa-a\">100</span> / 100 &bull; \n          Max Score: <span class=\"font-mono\">100</span> &bull; \n          % Impairment: <span class=\"font-mono text-indigo-600 dark:text-indigo-400\" data-visa-impair-target=\"visa-a\">0% Impairment</span>\n        </td>\n        <td class=\"text-center font-mono font-bold text-indigo-600 dark:text-indigo-400\">\n          <span class=\"excel-sum\" data-sum-target=\"visa-a\">100</span>\n        </td>\n        <td>\n          <span class=\"risk-pill risk-low\">Asymptomatic (&ge;90)</span>\n        </td>\n      </tr>\n    </tbody>\n  </table>\n</div>\n<p class=\"text-xs text-slate-400 mt-1\">Interpretation: &lt;60 = Severe Impairment &bull; 60-89 = Moderate Impairment &bull; &ge;90 = Recovered/Asymptomatic. MCID: 12-14 pts.</p>"
