    "title": "Cervical Spine Comprehensive Assessment",
    "category": "msk_templates",
    "content": "<h3>Cervical Spine Clinical Examination</h3>\n<p class=\"text-xs text-slate-500 mb-2\">Subjective: Onset, referral to scapula/upper extremity, 5 Ds & 3 Ns negative. No gait ataxia.</p>\n<div class=\"excel-table-wrap\">\n  <table class=\"excel-table\">\n    <thead>\n      <tr>\n        <th style=\"width: 30%;\">Movement<div class=\"col-resizer\"></div></th>\n        <th style=\"width: 20%;\" class=\"text-center\">Observed ROM<div class=\"col-resizer\"></div></th>\n        <th style=\"width: 25%;\">Pain Response<div class=\"col-resizer\"></div></th>\n        <th style=\"width: 25%;\">End-Feel<div class=\"col-resizer\"></div></th>\n      </tr>\n    </thead>\n    <tbody>\n      <tr><td>Flexion (0 - 50°)</td><td><input type=\"text\" class=\"excel-input text-center\" placeholder=\"°\" /></td><td><input type=\"text\" class=\"excel-input\" placeholder=\"Pain-free\" /></td><td><input type=\"text\" class=\"excel-input\" placeholder=\"Tissue stretch\" /></td></tr>\n      <tr><td>Extension (0 - 60°)</td><td><input type=\"text\" class=\"excel-input text-center\" placeholder=\"°\" /></td><td><input type=\"text\" class=\"excel-input\" placeholder=\"Pain-free\" /></td><td><input type=\"text\" class=\"excel-input\" placeholder=\"Firm\" /></td></tr>\n      <tr><td>Lateral Flexion (0 - 45°)</td><td><input type=\"text\" class=\"excel-input text-center\" placeholder=\"° / °\" /></td><td><input type=\"text\" class=\"excel-input\" placeholder=\"Symmetric\" /></td><td><input type=\"text\" class=\"excel-input\" placeholder=\"Tissue stretch\" /></td></tr>\n      <tr><td>Rotation (0 - 80°)</td><td><input type=\"text\" class=\"excel-input text-center\" placeholder=\"° / °\" /></td><td><input type=\"text\" class=\"excel-input\" placeholder=\"Symmetric\" /></td><td><input type=\"text\" class=\"excel-input\" placeholder=\"Tissue stretch\" /></td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n  </table>\n</div>\n<p class=\"text-xs font-semibold text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300 mt-2\">Special Tests: Spurling's [ Neg / Pos ] &bull; Distraction [ Relief / Neg ] &bull; ULTT1 Median [ Neg / Pos ].</p>"
