    "category": "msk_templates",
    "content": "<h3>Lumbar Spine Clinical Examination</h3>\n<p class=\"text-xs text-slate-500 mb-2\">Subjective: Directional preference, dermatomal referral, red flags negative (no saddle anesthesia, normal bowel/bladder).</p>\n<div class=\"excel-table-wrap\">\n  <table class=\"excel-table\">\n    <thead>\n      <tr>\n        <th style=\"width: 30%;\">Motion<div class=\"col-resizer\"></div></th>\n        <th style=\"width: 20%;\" class=\"text-center\">Observed ROM<div class=\"col-resizer\"></div></th>\n        <th style=\"width: 25%;\">Repeated Movement<div class=\"col-resizer\"></div></th>\n        <th style=\"width: 25%;\">Pain Response<div class=\"col-resizer\"></div></th>\n      </tr>\n    </thead>\n    <tbody>\n      <tr><td>Flexion</td><td><input type=\"text\" class=\"excel-input text-center\" placeholder=\"cm / °\" /></td><td><input type=\"text\" class=\"excel-input\" placeholder=\"No change\" /></td><td><input type=\"text\" class=\"excel-input\" placeholder=\"Pain on return\" /></td></tr>\n      <tr><td>Extension</td><td><input type=\"text\" class=\"excel-input text-center\" placeholder=\"°\" /></td><td><input type=\"text\" class=\"excel-input\" placeholder=\"Centralizes\" /></td><td><input type=\"text\" class=\"excel-input\" placeholder=\"End-range stiff\" /></td></tr>\n      <tr><td>Side Glide (L / R)</td><td><input type=\"text\" class=\"excel-input text-center\" placeholder=\"Symmetric\" /></td><td><input type=\"text\" class=\"excel-input\" placeholder=\"No change\" /></td><td><input type=\"text\" class=\"excel-input\" placeholder=\"Pain-free\" /></td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n  </table>\n</div>\n<p class=\"text-xs font-semibold text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300 mt-2\">Neurodynamics: Straight Leg Raise (SLR) L: ___° R: ___° &bull; Slump Test: [ Neg / Pos ].</p>"
